---
import './design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from './SketchSheet.astro';
import SketchArrow from './SketchArrow.astro';
---
<figure id="normalisation-overview" class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface normalisation-overview wide" aria-labelledby="normalisation-overview-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Normalisation</span>
  <h3 id="normalisation-overview-title">Keep a customer’s name with the customer</h3>
  <div class="overview-layout">
    <section class="repeated-layout" aria-labelledby="repeated-layout-title">
      <h4 id="repeated-layout-title">Customer details repeated in each order</h4>
      <div class="before-sheet">
        <SketchSheet tone="amber">
          <div class="sheet-content">
            <h5>orders</h5>
            <div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Orders with repeated customer names">
              <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">order_id</th><th scope="col">customer_id</th><th scope="col">name</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row"><code>O12</code></th><td><code>C4</code></td><td class="repeated-name">Ada</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row"><code>O13</code></th><td><code>C4</code></td><td class="repeated-name">Ada</td></tr>
              </tbody></table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </SketchSheet>
        <svg class="copy-bracket" viewBox="0 0 170 35" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 Q7 15 15 15 L156 16 Q162 16 162 3 M85 16 L84 31" /><path class="pencil-echo" d="M10 4 Q8 13 16 14 L155 15" /></svg>
        <p class="copy-label">The same current name, twice</p>
      </div>
      <p class="change-note">Correct Ada’s current name?<br /><strong>Two copies need changing.</strong></p>
    </section>
    <div class="split-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><div class="split-line"><SketchArrow /></div><span>Separate the<br />customer facts</span></div>
    <section class="shared-layout" aria-labelledby="shared-layout-title">
      <h4 id="shared-layout-title">Customers and orders stored separately</h4>
      <div class="shared-sheets">
        <div class="customer-table">
          <SketchSheet tone="teal">
            <div class="sheet-content">
              <h5>customers</h5>
              <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">customer_id</th><th scope="col">name</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row" class="shared-id"><code>C4</code></th><td class="shared-name">Ada</td></tr>
              </tbody></table>
            </div>
          </SketchSheet>
        </div>
        <div class="reference-bridge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M226 97 Q228 65 226 53 Q224 46 214 46 L77 45 Q65 44 65 32 L66 5" /><path class="arrowhead" d="M58 16 L66 4 L74 17" /><path class="pencil-echo" d="M228 94 L228 55 Q226 48 216 48 L78 47" /></svg>
          <p><code>C4</code> refers to<br />one customer</p>
        </div>
        <div class="orders-table">
          <SketchSheet>
            <div class="sheet-content">
              <h5>orders</h5>
              <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">order_id</th><th scope="col">customer_id</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row"><code>O12</code></th><td class="shared-id"><code>C4</code></td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row"><code>O13</code></th><td class="shared-id"><code>C4</code></td></tr>
              </tbody></table>
            </div>
          </SketchSheet>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="change-note shared-note">Correct Ada’s current name?<br /><strong>One customer row changes.</strong></p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Both designs record the same two orders and their customer. In the second, customer IDs still repeat in orders: they are references. The current name is stored once per customer. Only order identities and customer details are shown; products, prices and other fields are omitted.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .normalisation-overview.wide { margin-left:50%; }
  .overview-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 5rem minmax(0,1fr); gap:1.2rem; margin:1.8rem .2rem 1.4rem; }
  .overview-layout section { min-width:0; margin:0; }
  .overview-layout h4 { min-height:3rem; font-weight:500; }
  .sheet-content { padding:.1rem 0 .15rem; }
  .overview-layout h5 { margin:0 0 .35rem; padding:.1rem .4rem .55rem; font:500 .92rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); }
  .overview-layout table { table-layout:fixed; }
  .overview-layout th { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .overview-layout thead th { font-size:.75rem; }
  .overview-layout tbody tr:last-child > * { border-bottom:0; }
  .table-scroll { max-width:100%; overflow-x:auto; }
  .table-scroll:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--teal); outline-offset:3px; }
  .before-sheet { padding-top:4.3rem; }
  .repeated-name { background:linear-gradient(177deg,transparent 12%,var(--paper-highlight) 14% 88%,transparent 90%); }
  .shared-id,.shared-name { background:linear-gradient(177deg,transparent 12%,var(--paper-match) 14% 88%,transparent 90%); }
  .shared-name { font-weight:600; }
  .copy-bracket { display:block; width:48%; height:2.2rem; margin:.5rem 0 0 auto; color:var(--gold); }
  .copy-bracket path { fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.2; stroke-linecap:round; }
  .pencil-echo { opacity:.35; }
  .design-figure .copy-label { margin:0 0 0 auto; max-width:70%; text-align:right; font-size:.76rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .change-note { font-size:.8rem; margin:1.7rem .2rem 0; }
  .shared-note { padding-left:10%; }
  .split-arrow { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.6rem; text-align:center; align-self:start; padding-top:10rem; font-size:.7rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .split-line { width:100%; }
  .customer-table { width:88%; }
  .orders-table { width:88%; margin-left:auto; }
  .reference-bridge { position:relative; height:6rem; color:var(--teal); }
  .reference-bridge svg { width:100%; height:100%; overflow:visible; }
  .reference-bridge path { fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.5; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke; }
  .reference-bridge .arrowhead { stroke-width:1.7; }
  .reference-bridge p { position:absolute; inset:.3rem .5rem auto auto; margin:0; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.4; }
  @media(max-width:700px) {
    .overview-layout { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:.8rem; margin:1.3rem 0; }
    .overview-layout h4 { min-height:0; }
    .before-sheet { padding-top:.2rem; }
    .split-arrow { flex-direction:row; align-items:center; text-align:left; padding:0 0 0 1rem; gap:1rem; margin:.5rem 0 1.2rem; }
    .split-line { width:2.8rem; transform:rotate(90deg); }
    .shared-layout { margin-top:.5rem; }
    .sheet-content { padding:0; }
    .overview-layout thead th { font-size:.71rem; }
    .customer-table,.orders-table { width:91%; }
    .change-note { margin-top:1rem; }
  }
</style>
